    "source": "N = 2048\ndef merge(left, right, marker):\n    before = marker \u002B 1\n    mapping = {\u0027before\u0027:before, **left, \u0027marker\u0027:marker, **right}\n    members = {before, *left.values(), marker, *right.values()}\n    return mapping[\u0027before\u0027] \u002B mapping[\u0027marker\u0027] \u002B len(members)\nleft = {\u0027left\u0027:1}\nright = {\u0027right\u0027:2}\ntotal = 0\nfor i in range(N):\n    total \u002B= merge(left, right, i)\nprint(total)\n",
